---
description: Case study body layout rules for portfolio case study pages
globs: "*-case-study/index.html"
alwaysApply: false
---
- Body text in a case study never fills the full content width. Text sits in a column no wider than 50% on desktop, with an image or [IMG: ...] placeholder in the other column, alternating sides.
- Columns stack on screens 900px wide and under, image below the text.
- Full-width visuals, stats bands, and banners are the only full-width elements.
- Reuse the existing .block--split patterns. Do not add new colors or fonts.
- No em dashes in copy.
